  entries:
  - id: 1
    promt_id: 0
    answer: 'I would come here freshman year at midnight to get away from my roommate.
      I had the raccoons to keep me company, but I still felt alone. '
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fce4d596059264a998f008cb64b17a76, type: 3}
    position: {x: 215.39716, y: 1.0099998, z: 315.7782}
    dataPosted: 2026-04-15 15:11:18
  - id: 2
    promt_id: 0
    answer: This beautiful grove was so awe inspiring and despite being with friends
      I felt alone...
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5cfd907705e6545c888bb6074d6c5b4b, type: 3}
    position: {x: 180.34207, y: 1.0832467, z: 358.75525}
    dataPosted: 2026-04-15 15:16:09
  - id: 3
    promt_id: 0
    answer: Freshman year I felt the most alone when I was going to sleep and saw
      glow in the dark letters spray painted on my walls. My roomate WAS NOT THERE.
      This was not a prank and i felt ALONE AND SCARED AS HELL!
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bf4b3fedd2351496495b95929e350f39, type: 3}
    position: {x: 274.35287, y: 1.3885605, z: 263.40405}
    dataPosted: 2026-04-15 15:19:17
  - id: 4
    promt_id: 0
    answer: I was doing laundry and I was about to go downstairs to get it but then
      I saw a turkey blocking my path... No one was there to help me and I was scared
      so I left.
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4aaf897cc8c7f4f81abc3a687f32623f, type: 3}
    position: {x: 375.80377, y: 1.0099998, z: 336.83728}
    dataPosted: 2026-04-15 15:25:14
